<b>VRN:</b> 40-032826C
</div>

</i>

</div>


<hr style="margin-top:20px">


<div class="title">
SITE MATERIAL ESTIMATE REPORT
</div>


<hr>


<br>


<table>

<tr>
<th width="30%">
Concrete Class
</th>

<td>
Class ${selectedClass.value}
</td>
</tr>


<tr>
<th>
